WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.758
Phones are everywhere. Let's learn some phone language!

2
00:00:05.208 --> 00:00:07.066
This man is dialing a number.

3
00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:10.802
She's texting a friend.

4
00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:16.349
At the cinema, you should put your phone on silent mode.

5
00:00:16.799 --> 00:00:18.331
It's good phone etiquette!

6
00:00:20.581 --> 00:00:24.482
Oh, no! The call was cut off in the middle of the conversation!

7
00:00:26.732 --> 00:00:29.054
No problem. He's calling back now.

8
00:00:29.504 --> 00:00:32.384
And you? Do you prefer calling or texting?

